{
  "id": "37",
  "title": "阴命赋",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“阴命赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凡观阴命，先观夫主之盛衰；次论身荣，要见子息之强弱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-627edf1a5e01135aacd8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "夫荣子旺，定知富贵荣华。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-b01abdf1cb988372bd98-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "子死夫衰，只是穷孤下贱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-fa9860f87049809870b1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有夫有子而贫寒者，盖因身在衰乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-a5775587f667327f7dee-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无夫无子而昌盛者，亦是身居旺地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-ce1d209850a94bf48246-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若贵人少者，不富亦昌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-d0e7df67fd5a88991f04-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "合贵神非妓即尼，论淫贱者。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-bc9ef9f5437f2af59813-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱伤官，暗招财损。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-63e02cda67c612429f19-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "招婿者，夫显于门户之中。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-a6391cac7223e24bb49f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏夫者，夫旺于日时之上。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-4d5db35b36fd9aa14bf0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "夫衰身旺，主为廉洁之人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-34d0a862817b55b28527-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "鬼旺身衰，必作孤寒之妇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-8ef8791998cbe0f1bef3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凡观阴命之五行，要精详于明辨矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "37-f56e337d7a2a880463df-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
